! Rigid TIP4P on NEWTIP. The step adapts to ACCRAT 0.5, which is
! GMIN's default and the acceptance ratio Wales and Hodges held
! for TIP4P. The temperature stays at 2 kJ/mol. STEPS is long so
! H2H_BUDGET is the stop. The driver appends one RANSEED line.

NTIP 4
SLOPPYCONV 1.0D-3
TIGHTCONV 1.0D-4
EDIFF 0.01
MAXIT 800 500
SAVE 2

TEMPERATURE 2.0
FIXTEMP
ACCEPTRATIO 0.5
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.40 0.51
